I had the same problem.  Used the below fix and have never had a problem
again.

DEC OSF1 has two options for swapping, and the default one is a real hog
for your swap space. The method can be changed by removing the symbolic
link "/sbin/swapdefault".  The 2 swap space methods are documented in the
Sys Admin Guide of the OSF manuals.

