>What is the source of /usr/share/dict/words?  As someone who is a bit nit-
>picky with the English language, I'm wondering how much I should trust this
>word list.  It might help, therefore, to know where this file originated,
>and therefore (hopefully) how authentic it is.

See the README in /usr/share/dict and the spell manual page for details. In
brief, 'words' is a file containing only words common to British and American.
