MAYNARD, MA -- July 21, 1994 -- Digital Equipment Corporation is pleased to
announce the immediate availability of DEC Fortran 90 V1.0 for DEC OSF/1
AXP which will compile and execute scalar Fortran 90 code.  Later this
fall, DEC Fortran 90 V1.1 will support a subset of the High Performance
