The problem is not with the sort command, but with the uniq command.

Under OSF/1 2.0, uniq is broken. 

hostname% uniq -c /dev/null             returns:
 1 "hostname%

Under Ultrix, SunOS 4.1.3, and Solaris 2.3, the same command returns:

hostname% uniq -c /dev/null
hostname%

I've copied the OSF/1 1.3 uniq binary to OSF/1 2.0, and that has solved the
problem.

