Two ways:

1. If you never use DECnet (good for you) then just edit 
   /usr/lib/X11/config/osf1.cf and remove ALL instances of "-DDNETCONN".
   Then in your source distribution you're working on, rebuild all the
   Makefiles.

2. If you do use DECnet (my condolences) then you need to include the
   library /usr/ccs/lib/libdnet_stub.a (eg, "-ldnet_stub").

