> What do I have to do on the ALPHA to allow another machine to print
> to the lp queue??  I've looked at the on-line documentation now 
> for hours and can't seem to find the answer.
> 
> /etc/hosts.lpd  perhaps? (but what would it look like?)

The hold name needs to appear either in /etc/hosts or in /etc/hosts.lpd.
Use hosts.lpd if you are using BIND or YP (er, NIS) for resolving host names
into addresses.

The format of /etc/hosts.lpd is simply a list of host names, one
per line.

