The format of the MAKEDEV command is:

	MAKEDEV dev?

where the dev is defined as (in the case of a multiply-partitioned
object) the base name of the device such as rtm1. If MAKEDEV (which is
a shellscript) recognizes the type, it will fork off mknod with the
proper parameters to create all of the sub-devices.

