I can't comment on the sluggishness of OSF2.0. But when you telnet into osf it tries to
lookup your name through ip address so if you have any problem looking up the name of your
system given its ip address, telnetd will be delayed. To rule this out place its name 
and ip address in /etc/hosts and  if the problem is solved debug the name server.
Mike


